{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bullet Yeeters \u2014 Jetpack Chaos in Your Own Backyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for high-flying mayhem where tiny agents with big guns turn your home into a battlefield! Bullet Yeeters is a chaotic third-person shooter with jetpack-powered movement,\u00a0 over-the-top physics, and explosive action in giant household environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2708\ufe0f <strong>JETPACK COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master aerial movement and outmaneuver your enemies mid-air. Use your jetpack to dodge, strafe, and surprise from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/Jump.gif?t=1744363033\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfe0 HOUSEHOLD WARZONES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in oversized kitchens, garages, living rooms, and more. Everyday objects become tactical cover, traps, or high ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/BR_1.gif?t=1744363033\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2b</strong> <strong>CUSTOM AGENTS &amp; WILD WEAPONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and personalize agents with unique abilities. Customize jetpacks, gear, and outfits. Choose from a huge arsenal of upgradable guns.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/Wardrobe.gif?t=1744363033\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udca5 GIANT BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down ridiculous oversized bosses solo or in co-op. Every battle is a spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/BOSS.gif?t=1744363033\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae PURE MAYHEM, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free-for-All, Battle Royale, Control Point \u2014 or even The Floor is Lava. Solo or with friends, it\u2019s always chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/extras/Maps_8.gif?t=1744363033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly fast. Shoot hard. Yeet or be yeeted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624020?t=1744363033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624020?t=1744363033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/5513e139625b7dbcfda32e78edef6e9de598d1df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744363033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624020/5513e139625b7dbcfda32e78edef6e9de598d1df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744363033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bullet Yeeters \u2014 Jetpack Chaos in Your Own Backyard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for high-flying mayhem where tiny agents with big guns turn your home into a battlefield! Bullet Yeeters is a chaotic third-person shooter with jetpack-powered movement,\u00a0 over-the-top physics, and explosive action in giant household environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2708\ufe0f <strong>JETPACK COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragr